  "body": "Coding agents cannot discover or read the configured skill library through MCP. Expose bounded skill discovery and instruction reads on local and hosted surfaces.\n\nConstraint: Reading a skill must not install it, execute it, or overwrite a person's skill files.\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [ ] List matching skill names and descriptions with pagination.\n- [ ] Read a selected skill with an explicit character limit.\n- [ ] Resolve hosted workspace scope from the authenticated token and check repository access.\n- [ ] Support local skill discovery without requiring a checkout.\n- [ ] Cover missing skills, unavailable libraries, limits, and workspace isolation through MCP.\n",
